>>>> =F0=9F=8D=AB *Chocolate and Confectionery Commodities*
>>>> While Bunge does not export finished cocoa or chocolate bars directly,
>>>> they are global experts in industrial confectionery ingredients. [1
>>>> <https://www.bunge.com/Markets-We-Serve/Confectionery>]
>>>>
>>>>    - *Offerings:* They provide specialty lipids, lecithins, and cocoa
