>>>>    - *Sourcing:* Their ingredients are widely integrated into recipes
>>>>    for coated bars, truffles, and creamy spreads globally. [1
>>>>    <https://www.bunge.com/Markets-We-Serve/Confectionery>]
>>>>
>>>> =F0=9F=8C=BF *Soy Sourcing and Trade*
>>>>
>>>>    - *EU Supply:* Bunge is a primary supplier of Argentine and South
>>>>    American soy animal feed (soybean meal and cake) to the meat and da=
iry
>>>>    industries across the EU. [1
>>>>    <https://mightyearth.org/article/major-european-supermarkets-launch=
-investigations-over-us-animal-feed-giant-bunges-links-to-cerrado-deforesta=
tion/>
>>>>    ]
>>>>    - *Traceability:* Operating a fully integrated value chain, Bunge
>>>>    achieved 100% monitoring and traceability for direct and indirect s=
oy
>>>>    sourcing in high-risk regions like Argentina's Gran Chaco. [1
>>>>    <https://www.bunge.com/Sustainability/Our-Commodities>, 2
>>>>    <https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bunge_responsible-supply-chains-soy=
-activity-7452015995646369792-UbJd>,
>>>>    3 <https://www.bunge.com/-/media/files/pdf/10th_soy_progress_report=
>
>>>>    ]
>>>>    - *Sustainability:* They have implemented strict zero-deforestation
>>>>    mandates and regenerative agriculture programs across their South A=
merican
>>>>    supply chains. [1
>>>>    <https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bunge_responsible-supply-chains-soy=
-activity-7452015995646369792-UbJd>
>>>>    ]
>>>>
>>>> =F0=9F=A5=A9 *Beef and Livestock Feed*
>>>>
>>>>    - While Bunge is an agricultural trader and processor (crushing soy
>>>>    into meal for animal feed), they *do not directly export raw beef*.
>>>>    - Instead, Bunge provides the *soybean meal and other essential
>>>>    animal feed ingredients* that sustain the livestock supply chains
>>>>    in Argentina and the EU. [1
